# Stranglethorn Vale (46-47): the Horde quests of Grom'gol and Booty Bay, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/stranglethorn_vale_46_47.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Stranglethorn Vale, area 33).
# The guide's quest list is section 9 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the earlier
# Stranglethorn quests are in Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43), the later ones (608,
# Whiskey Slim, Cortello, the Monogrammed Sash...) in Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50).
# Carried in: I Know a Guy (95295, Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port, Riverglades (44-45)) and
# Back to Booty Bay (1118, Kravel Koalbeard at the Mirage Raceway, Tanaris (43-43)).
# Added: Unbagwa's Stranglethorn Fever (349): ten Gorilla Fangs make him summon Mokk the Savage for Fin Fizracket's
# Stranglethorn Fever (348).
# Added: Grim Message (2932), taken from Nimboya at Grom'gol and left to The Hinterlands (48-49),
# where the Witherbark trolls drop its skulls; Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50) hands it in.
# Left out: Terror of the Desert Skies (78823): its Primitive Drawing drops only from the
# Dustbelcher ogres of the Badlands, which no guide of the series visits.
# Data filled in here: the Bloodsail Trunk of Get the Goods (95322) has no place in the data (on the
# hill east of the Booty Bay tunnel); the Torn Mystical Scroll (95385) drops from Bloodsail Warlocks
# (outof.games, the warlock's drops), the data knows no item for it.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house for the Green Hills pages, level 46 training) and the
# zeppelin to Grom'gol; the Skullsplitter trolls; a flight to Booty Bay and three loops from it (the
# coast and the gorillas, the pirates of the Wild Shore, the Zanzil camps and the basilisks); back to
# Grom'gol and one long loop north (the crocolisks, Nesingwary's camp, the Venture Co. camp,
# Bhag'thera, the Mosh'Ogg mound); Booty Bay again and the south coast; Grom'gol; Powderfuse Port in
# the Riverglades for Ruzzgot's shipment, and a flight to Stonard for the next guide.

guide Stranglethorn Vale (46-47)
faction horde
levels 46 47
carry 1118 2741 3520 95295 95296
leave 580 2741 2932 3520 95296
next Swamp of Sorrows (47-47)

# Orgrimmar: the auction house and training -----------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
note "Come to Orgrimmar: the zeppelin to Stranglethorn Vale leaves from the tower outside its gates" at 55.9,62.7
ah 339.1 npc 8673
tip Barnil Stonepot at Nesingwary's camp collects the 15 pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. They drop rarely, from all over the jungle; the auction house sells them for a few silver each. Only the 15 page numbers listed here exist (1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26 and 27).
ah 339.2 npc 8673
ah 339.3 npc 8673
ah 339.4 npc 8673
ah 340.1 npc 8673
ah 340.2 npc 8673
ah 340.3 npc 8673
ah 340.4 npc 8673
