ah 341.2 npc 8673
ah 341.3 npc 8673
ah 341.4 npc 8673
ah 342.1 npc 8673
ah 342.2 npc 8673
ah 342.3 npc 8673
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity, druids in Thunder Bluff.

map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale" npc 12136
tip The zeppelin tower stands in Durotar, a short ride from the gate of Orgrimmar; Snurk Bucksquick at the top knows which zeppelin goes to Grom'gol.

# Grom'gol Base Camp ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Stranglethorn Vale
fpath 1387
bind 5814
accept 586
tip The Bubbling Cauldron stands next to Kin'weelay.
accept 571
accept 2932
tip Nimboya gives you his pike for the Witherbark trolls of the Hinterlands, a later guide: keep it in your bags. He takes the quest back when the guides bring you through Grom'gol again.

# East: the Skullsplitter trolls ------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 586.1 bg
tip The hunters roam the lower level of the ruins. The headhunters and berserkers stand on the upper level to the east (around 48,43), only four or five of each: kill the mystics there too, their spawns can come back as headhunters.
do 586.2 bg
do 586.3 bg
do 586.4
tip Ana'thek the Cruel waits with two guards in a cave on the lower level of the Ruins of Zul'Mamwe (around 44,44): skirt the ruins along the right-hand wall to reach it, and clear the guards before you pull him. He has an execute that hits very hard on a wounded target, so keep your health up.
do 586.1
do 586.2
do 586.3

