# North-east: the Zanzil camps and the basilisks ---------------------------------------------------------------

do 621 bg
do 609.1
do 609.2
tip Maury and Jon-Jon are at the Ruins of Jubuwal: Jon-Jon by the campfire, Maury inside a set of walls.
do 609.3
tip Chucky "Ten Thumbs" is at the Ruins of Aboraz, the Zanzil camp to the south-east: on the beach side, just outside the walls in a corner.
do 621
tip Farm the mixture at the Ruins of Aboraz by the sea (around 40,59): the mobs there stand apart and pull one at a time, while Jubuwal's are packed together. Leave Zanzil the Outcast himself alone; the witch doctors flee when they are hurt.
do 589
tip Only the Ironjaw Basilisks inside the Crystalvein Mine drop the shards, and often do; the Thrashtail Basilisks outside don't. The entrance is at about 41.8,50.1, north-east of the Ruins of Aboraz.

