# North: the crocolisks, Nesingwary's camp, the Venture Co., Bhag'thera and the Mosh'Ogg ogres ----------------

do 628
tip The Elder Saltwater Crocolisks are level 38 elites on the beach north of Grom'gol (around 29,24). They share spawn points with the plain Saltwater Crocolisks: if no elder is up, kill plain ones along the beach until one appears.
accept 338 339 340 341 342
accept 193
tip Barnil Stonepot, Hemet Nesingwary and Sir S. J. Erlgadin stand together in the hunters' camp.
do 339 340 341 342 bg
tip Every page you loot or buy counts; you hand in the chapters on your way back.
turnin 95325
tip The ledger is upstairs in the Venture Co. building by the lake.
accept 95326
do 95326
tip The agent waits inside the building but respawns only every 7-10 minutes. If he is dead, go on to Bhag'thera and the ogres and come back for him on your way west.
do 193
tip Bhag'thera, a level 40 elite panther, spawns at about 48,20 or 48,28 and prowls the hills between them. The target button finds her from afar.
do 613
tip The Mosh'Ogg ogres are elites: pull them one at a time. Any of them can drop the key, the lords and the butchers most often, and each of you needs one.
do 591
tip Mai'Zoth, a level 47 elite ogre, waits in the last room of the cave at the back of the Mosh'Ogg mound, with a guard that joins the fight. Crowd-control the guard if you can and kill Mai'Zoth first. It is a hard fight for two: skip it if it goes badly.

