do 573.1 bg
do 573.2
tip The water comes from clicking the spring, not from the nagas. Take the path at about 27,59, just before the bridge, up through an arch into the Nek'mani Wellspring, then over a rope bridge to the fountain-like spring (around 29,62). The nagas on the way come in pairs.
do 573.1
do 592 icon use "Use the Soul Gem on Yenniku, then talk to him"
tip Yenniku stands inside the first corridor of the Ruins of Aboraz (around 39,58). Don't fight him: the gem stuns him, and after a few seconds you can talk to him to fill it.

